-- Week of Mon 21 to Sun 27 September 2026, cooking for one. Two sessions, 16 portions.
-- Monday's is the 10-minute one because the shop does not get home until 9pm; Wednesday's
-- is the big one that carries the rest of the week and fills the freezer.

= 2026-09-21

-- 4 portions: Monday night, Tuesday lunch, Tuesday night, one spare for Wednesday lunch.
-- 20 minutes start to plate, all of it hands-on. Eat it within two days — gnocchi does not
-- keep past that.
@./recipes/dinner/Pork Kale and Gnocchi One Pot{}

= 2026-09-23

-- 12 portions: Wednesday to Sunday, dinner and lunch, and the rest frozen.
-- ~20 minutes hands-on (chopping) and 2 hours in the oven doing nothing. Start it when you get
-- in and it is done by 9. Four portions to the fridge, eight to the freezer — cooked mince is
-- a three-day thing in the fridge and this week is five.
@./recipes/dinner/Big Batch Bolognese{}
